    "title": "Davidson Township bracing for rain while cleaning up damage from previous storm - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Sullivan County, Pennsylvania\nDavidson Township bracing for rain while cleaning up damage from previous storm\n2 hours ago\nSULLIVAN COUNTY, Pa. — Davidson Township is still recovering from the damage left behind by the major rainstorm on Sunday night into Monday. \"The damage is definitely in the millions, the amount of debris that came off the mountain, and the amount of the water. Talking to DEP yesterday, he said he hasn't seen this amount of damage in a small area,” said Todd Carr, a Davidson Township supervisor.",
